 a"," Sunday","."," So"," Nov"," ","2"," Monday",","," Nov"," ","3"," Tuesday",","," Nov"," ","4"," Wednesday","."," Yes",","," upcoming"," weekend"," is"," Nov"," ","7","-","8",","," ","202","6",".\n\n","However",","," the"," browser"," time"," zone"," note"," says"," to"," ask"," user"," to"," clarify"," otherwise","-un","qualified"," dates","."," The"," user"," said"," \"","周末","\""," (","week","end",")"," without"," specific"," dates","."," Rather"," than"," asking",","," I"," could"," keep"," it"," generic"," (\"","周六","/","周日","\")"," without"," pin","ning"," specific"," dates",","," or"," mention"," the"," upcoming"," weekend"," date","."," To"," be"," safe",","," I","'ll"," keep"," it"," as"," generic"," ","周","六","/","周日"," with"," a"," placeholder"," for"," date",","," or"," just"," write"," \"","本","周末","（","日期","待","定","）","\"."," Actually"," asking"," would"," be"," annoying"," for"," such"," a"," simple"," task","."," I","'ll"," write"," the"," plan"," gener","ically"," for"," \"","周末","（","周六","出发","）","\""," without"," hard"," dates",","," maybe"," with"," a"," spot"," to"," fill"," in"," the"," date",".\n\n","Also"," details"," like"," mountain"," location"," are"," unknown","."," I"," shouldn","'t"," over","-","ask","."," I"," can"," make"," it"," a"," template","-style"," plan"," with"," a"," default"," assumption"," (","e",".g",".,"," 一","日","往返","的","近","郊","山","线","),"," and"," note"," adjustable","."," Keep"," it"," practical",".\n\n","Structure",":\n","1","."," ","装","备","清单"," (","first",","," as"," requested",")\n","  "," -"," ","服装","类","\n","  "," -"," ","背","包","/","登山","杖","\n","  "," -"," ","食","物","饮水","\n","  "," -"," 导","航","/","电子","\n","  "," -"," 安全","/","急救","\n","  "," -"," 其他","杂物","\n","2","."," 行","程","计划"," (","时间","表",")\n","3","."," ","路","线","概","要","\n","4","."," ","餐","食","安排","\n","5","."," 安全","须知","\n","6","."," 出","发","前","检查","\n\n","Let"," me"," check"," the"," directory"," first",","," then"," write","."," Actua