t write \"本周末（日期待定）\". Actually asking would be annoying for such a simple task. I'll write the plan generically for \"周末（周六出发）\" without hard dates, maybe with a spot to fill in the date.\n\nAlso details like mountain location are unknown. I shouldn't over-ask. I can make it a template-style plan with a default assumption (e.g., 一日往返的近郊山线), and note adjustable. Keep it practical.\n\nStructure:\n1. 装备清单 (first, as requested)\n   - 服装类\n   - 背包/登山杖\n   - 食物饮水\n   - 导航/电子\n   - 安全/急救\n   - 其他杂物\n2. 行程计划 (时间表)\n3. 路线概要\n4. 餐食安排\n5. 安全须知\n6. 出发前检查\n\nLet me check the directory first, then write. Actually glob for hike.md to see if it exists — if it exists I need to read before overwriting. Let me do that quickly."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845563589,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_0aed10272141466891484150","name":"glob","arguments":"{\"pattern\":\"hike.md\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845563589,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":284,"outputTokens":582,"totalTokens":9698,"cacheReadTokens":8832}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845563589,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"pi-ai","version":2,"api":"openai-completions","provider":"litellm","model":"glm-5.3","responseId":"chatcmpl-e7acfbb3-d9ca-4dc4-9b86-804e972e4360","stopReason":"toolUse"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}}
