四","、","雨天","备用","方案","\\n\\n","-"," **","小雨","/","阵雨","**","：","正常","出行","，","强化","防水","——","背包","罩"," +"," 手机","/","衣物","用","密封","袋","，","穿","硬","壳","外套","和","防","滑","徒步","鞋","，","避开","溪","谷","、","陡","坡","湿","滑","路段","。\\n","-"," **","持续","中","雨","或","雷电","**","：","放弃","登山","，","改","期","。","可选","替代","活动","：","低","海拔","步","道","散步","、","室内","攀","岩","、","逛","博物馆","/","泡","温泉","。\\n","-"," **","临时","遇","雨","**","：","立即","停止","上升","，","远离","山","脊","、","孤","树","和","开阔","地","；","下方","谷","地","可能有","山","洪","，","往","高处","稳固","处","躲避","；","穿","保温","层","防止","失","温","。\\n","-"," **","决策","原则","**","：","出发","前"," ","12"," 小","时","再次","确认","天气预报","；","只要","出现","雷电","、","暴雨","或","大风","预警","，","一律","改","期","，","不","冒险","上山","。\"","}"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845607064,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"The user wants me to add a rainy day backup plan (雨天备用方案) to the existing hike.md. Let me read the current file first (I created it, but per policy I should read before editing — actually I just created it in this session, so editing is fine, but let me read it to get exact text for the edit).\n\nActually I have the content from when I wrote it. But to be safe and precise, I can just use the edit tool with text I know exists. The file was created by me in this session, so I can edit directly.\n\nWhere to add it? A good spot: after the \"注意事项\" section or within it. The user says \"补一条：雨天备用方案\" — add one item/section about rainy day backup plan. I'll add a new section \"四、雨天备用方案\" after 注意事项, or add it as an item in 注意事项. \"补一条\" suggests adding one entry. But a backup plan is better as a small section. Given item 5 in 注意事项 already mentions weather contingency (\"若预报有雷暴...果断改期\"), I could add a dedicated section with concrete alternatives.\n\nI think adding a new section \"四、雨天备用方案\" after the notes makes sense, keeping it concise. Let me do the edit."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845607064,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_546d78eea1354745b057d553","name":"edit","arguments":"{\"file_path\":\"hike.md\",\"old_string\":\"6. **无痕山林**：不折花木、不留垃圾、不偏离既有步道。\",\"new_string\":\"6. **无痕山林**：不折花木、不留垃圾、不偏离既有步道。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 四、雨天备用方案\\n\\n- **小雨/阵雨**：正常出行，强化防水——背包罩 + 手机/衣物用密封袋，穿硬壳外套和防滑徒步鞋，避开溪谷、陡坡湿滑路段。\\n- **持续中雨或雷电**：放弃登山，改期。可选替代活动：低海拔步道散步、室内攀岩、逛博物馆/泡温泉。\\n- **临时遇雨**：立即停止上升，远离山脊、孤树和开阔地；下方谷地可能有山洪，往高处稳固处躲避；穿保温层防止失温。\\n- **决策原则**：出发前 12 小时再次确认天气预报；只要出现雷电、暴雨或大风预警，一律改期，不冒险上山。\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845607065,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":217,"outputTokens":497,"totalTokens":10826,"cacheReadTokens":10112}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1793845607065,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"pi-ai","version":2,"api":"openai-completions","provider":"litellm","model":"glm-5.3","responseId":"chatcmpl-2318b8f1-f86e-478c-a86b-242013d0282f","stopReason":"toolUse"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}}
